; Audited against data/effects.txt TEXT, lines 684-722; corrected locally.
; Self private state: 246=properly summoned by own procedure, 247=equipped by
; this effect, 248=controlled monster, 249=controller before this control effect.
; Initialize private state to zero; clear 246 when a new card instance is created.
; End Phase A1 is this card destruction snapshot: SUBJECT=39,
; DESTROYED_AND_SENT_THIS_TURN=78, SOURCE_ZONE=61, destroying card controller=79,
; destruction turn=122 (same numbering as Duel.122). The card must still be in GY.
; Continuous program 4 must run on equipment/state changes, including departure.
; Native CONTROL relocates the monster and updates CONTROLLER; storage allocates
; a legal slot or reports failure. Normal equip cleanup clears the link on departure.
; Summon-rule consumers use 246 to satisfy the must-first-summon restriction.

